===============================================================================
2. PERMITTED USE WITHOUT A LICENCE
===============================================================================

You may, without asking and without payment:

  (a) Print one copy of any course book for your own personal study, if you are
      an enrolled learner of that course.

  (b) Print copies of a course book for the learners in a cohort you are
      facilitating, if you are a facilitator delivering a JD Hub Academy
      course under a current agreement.

  (c) Quote up to 200 words from any book in a review, article, teaching note,
      or scholarly work, provided you attribute it clearly as:

          "Mubogi Gastavas Jordan, JD Hub Academy"

  (d) Read, study and learn from the Material.

===============================================================================
3. PROHIBITED WITHOUT A WRITTEN LICENCE
===============================================================================

You may not:

  (a) Sell, resell, or rent the Material, in whole or in part.

  (b) Rebrand the Material as your own course, book, or curriculum.

  (c) Remove, obscure, or alter the author's name, the copyright notice, or the
      JD Hub Academy branding.

  (d) Upload the Material to any file-sharing service, public repository, or
      website, or distribute it by any means to people outside your cohort.

  (e) Use the Material to deliver paid training, whether in person or online,
      unless you hold a current JD Hub Academy facilitator licence.

  (f) Create derivative works, translations, or adaptations for commercial use.

  (g) Use the JD Hub name, logo, or branding in connection with any training
      you deliver without a written licence.

  (h) Use the Material to train an artificial-intelligence model or to build a
      competing educational product.

===============================================================================
4. FACILITATOR AND INSTITUTIONAL LICENCES
===============================================================================

Licences are available for:

  - Individual facilitators wishing to deliver JD Hub Academy courses
  - Schools, colleges, churches, NGOs and companies wishing to deliver the
    curriculum to their own staff or students under their own brand

A licence grants the right to deliver the courses to a defined audience for a
defined period, using the Material as published, with the rubrics applied as
written. It does not transfer ownership.

Enquiries: JD Hub Academy, JD Hub Tech, Kampala, Uganda.

===============================================================================
5. LEARNER ENROLMENT
===============================================================================

Enrolment in a JD Hub Academy course grants the enrolled learner a personal,
non-transferable licence to use the course book for their own study and in their
own work, permanently. It does not grant the right to teach the material to
others for payment.

